<!DOCTYPE RCC><RCC version="1.0">
    <!-- Runtime paths are :/cards/<rank>_of_<suit>.<ext> - the alias strips the
         source directory, so moving the files does not move the URLs.

         Two formats are embedded side by side under the same alias stem: the
         raster set (images/cards/png/) and the vector set (images/cards/svg/). -->
